/crates/irohad/.tmp*/
# irohad_lib unit tests create owner-only custody roots in the crate directory:
# the code under test checks every ancestor of the root, so the shared system
# temporary directory cannot hold them. A test process that is killed leaves
# them behind; they are never source.
/crates/irohad/.retained-attempt-*/
/crates/irohad/.beacon-attempt-*/
/crates/irohad/.beacon-phase-*/
/crates/irohad/.beacon-export-*/
